From 2af9fb87b91001c4f5d248eb3e08fecc9c953582 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shota <monyuonyu@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 05:40:45 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 199/200] Gui: Do not ask to reload a file that was deleted

The source editor asked whether to reload a file changed outside it
also when the file was gone, which cannot be reloaded; unattended runs
(the GUI test suite, whose macro editor test left an editor with a
deleted temporary file behind) then waited forever. The test now also
deletes its editor when it closes it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
